# Runtime provider secrets. Example only.
#
# In production this file lives at /etc/leitbild/runtime.env on the deploy
# host, chmod 600, owned by root. The leitbild.service systemd unit loads it
# via EnvironmentFile=-/etc/leitbild/runtime.env (the leading `-` makes the
# file optional — missing credentials disable the corresponding provider
# rather than crash the server).
#
# Never commit a real key. The example file is tracked so newcomers know
# what variables exist and where to set them.

# OpenSky Network OAuth2 client_credentials (Phase B.2). Generate at
# https://opensky-network.org → account → API Client (one client per
# operator). Without these the aviation.opensky provider is unavailable;
# scenarios that opt into it (e.g. norway-airspace) will fail to start a
# Control Instance.
OPENSKY_CLIENT_ID=
OPENSKY_CLIENT_SECRET=

# VATSIM provider (Phase B.3) — no auth required at the API layer; the
# placeholder block is here so the env file stays the canonical reference.
# VATSIM_DATA_URL=
